cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
title: "CDB90: A tidy, open-data version of the CAA Database of Battles (1990)"
type: dataset
version: 10.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
authors:
  - family-names: Arnold
    given-names: Jeffrey B.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23928303
repository-code: https://github.com/jrnold/CDB90
license: CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - battles
  - military history
  - warfare
  - CDB90
abstract: >-
  A tidier version of CDB90, the US Army Concepts Analysis Agency Database of Battles (Version
  1990): 660 battles fought between 1600 and 1973, as flat CSV and Parquet tables (with the HERO narratives of 586 battles), a relational
  SQLite database and a Frictionless Data Package, with links to Wikidata and Wikipedia and
  coordinates for 655 battles.
references:
  - type: report
    title: "Database of Battles, Version 1990 (Computer Diskette)"
    authors:
      - name: U.S. Army Concepts Analysis Agency
    number: DTIC ADM-000121
    year: 1991
